OL,3,GNEWSA'Orange Order put us through hell'
OL,4,Asay Garvaghy Road residents
OL,5,
OL,6,FA residents group in Portadown has
OL,7,Faccused the Orange Order of putting
OL,8,Ftheir community "through hell" with
OL,9,Fparades.
OL,11,FBreandan Mac Cionnaith, a spokesperson
OL,12,Ffor Garvaghy Road Residents Coalition,
OL,13,Fsaid the order should be apologising to
OL,14,Fthe people rather than marching in the
OL,15,Farea.
OL,17,FHis comments come as Portadown Orange
OL,18,FOrder prepares to apply for another
OL,19,FDrumcree parade which would include the
OL,20,FGarvaghy Road.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
